rID":"achiev_07","strName":"Turbo Blade","strDescription":"Unlock Turbo Blade","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/539720/dc868151a84a71218a8cfdedfa63f48c2704b687.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":4,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achiev_08","strName":"Furia","strDescription":"Unlock Furia","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/539720/dc868151a84a71218a8cfdedfa63f48c2704b687.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":3.4000000953674316,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"achiev_09","strName":"X-1984","strDescription":"Unlock X-1984","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/539720/dc868151a84a71218a8cfdedfa63f48c2704b687.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":2.5999999046325684,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":9,"nAchieved":0}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"NukGames","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/NukGames"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"NukGames","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/NukGames"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"NukGames","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/NukGames"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[url=http://discord.nukgames.com/][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/a1b9e023621e6a05946acb58e48a5085.poster.avif?t=1762262907\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/a1b9e023621e6a05946acb58e48a5085.webm?t=1762262907\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"][/imgvid][/url]\r\n[b]RAZORTRON 2000[/b] 是一款复古的自上而下的无尽赛车游戏。尝试击败你的高分，解锁新车，并在这封给食币街机时代的情书上登上排行榜的榜首！\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/173458ead379d5e3e3cc4bc5c7ad4cf3.poster.avif?t=1762262907\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/173458ead379d5e3e3cc4bc5c7ad4cf3.webm?t=1762262907\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid]\r\n[列表][*]在程序生成的路径和交通上避免交通、侧边障碍和燃料耗尽。\r\n[*]每辆车都改变了游戏的整个调色板，创造了另一种体验。[/list]\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/7eaaef9d9e5382571e8b02bff60cf624.poster.avif?t=1762262907\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/7eaaef9d9e5382571e8b02bff60cf624.webm?t=1762262907\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid]\r\n[*]当您想要快速拍摄美学，或者在有趣的小型可重玩游戏中排队等待另一场比赛时，非常适合玩。尝试解锁新车并在几分钟内提高你的分数。\r\n[*]灵感来自 80 年代和 90 年代的经典赛车游戏，如公路霸王、间谍猎人、超级冲刺。\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/3254ce5719dd54f57be0c03605a26bdb.poster.avif?t=1762262907\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539720/extras/3254ce5719dd54f57be0c03605a26bdb.webm?t=1762262907\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid]\r\n[*]具有美学氛围的美丽复古像素艺术。\r\n[*]10 辆可解锁的汽车，每辆都有不同的规格。\r\n[*]无尽的程序生成路径和流量。\r\n[*]原创配乐，包含 Derek Volker 的 10 首合成波风格音乐。\r\n[*]Steam 成就、排行榜、集换式卡牌和云端存档。","strSnippet":"RAZORTRON 2000 是一款复古的自上而下的无尽赛车游戏。尝试击败你的高分，解锁新车，并在这封给食币街机时代的情书上登上排行榜的榜首！"}}]]